{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover Siberia from a new perspective! \u201cGates of Siberia\u201d is a unique interactive VR adventure that allows you to travel back in time to the Tyumen region!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forget about boring textbooks!</strong> Put on a VR headset or grab a mouse and keyboard, and <strong>become a participant in key events of the past, exploring different eras and locations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Ermak&quot;:</strong> Take part in Ermak's campaign, opening Siberia for Russia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Tyumen Fortress&quot;:</strong> Feel like a pioneer and take part in the construction of the first Russian fortress in Siberia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cGagarin\u2019s Treasure\u201d:</strong> Solve the secrets of the dungeons of the Tobolsk Kremlin and find the treasures of the first Governor of Siberia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cOsnova\u201d:</strong> Prepare the first steamship on the Siberian rivers for sailing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Escape from the Prison Castle&quot;:</strong> Escape from the gloomy Prison Castle and test your strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;The Romanovs&quot;:</strong> Witness the last days of the Romanov family in Tobolsk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Civil&quot;:</strong> Take part in team battles on the battlefields of the Civil War.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cCity of Labor Valor\u201d:</strong> Fulfill a defense order at a plant evacuated to Tyumen during the Great Patriotic War.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Tyumen Oil&quot;:</strong> Witness the beginning of the oil and gas era in Siberia and drill the first well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spies:</strong> Outsmart your enemy in a standoff between the KGB and the CIA in 1960s Tyumen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique VR experience:</strong> Full immersion into the past with the ability to interact with the environment as in reality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full VR emulation for PC:</strong> Enjoy all the possibilities of a VR tour even without a VR headset, using a mouse and keyboard, with emulation of hands and head controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactivity:</strong> Become not an observer, but an active participant in historical events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team modes:</strong> Complete quests and take part in battles with friends or other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Historical accuracy:</strong> All events and locations are based on real historical facts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many episodes:</strong> Discover the entire history of the Tyumen region!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cGates of Siberia\u201d is not just a game, it is an interactive journey into the past!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1846410?t=1740586774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740586774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740586774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740586774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","